 DemoAutoConf connected;mkbox;COORD;LF
⍝ Demonstrates the Attach and AutoConf properties. Drag the vertical splitter
⍝ to resize the two panes (width) and watch each labelled box reconfigure
⍝ according to its Attach edges, gated by its AutoConf.
 EWC.CONNECTED←connected
 ⎕PW←1000
 COORD←'Pixel'
 LF←⎕UCS 10   ⍝ a newline in a Label caption makes it wrap (else it clips)

⍝ mkbox ⍵ = (name caption Posn Size BCol Attach AutoConf) -> a coloured,
⍝ bordered SubForm "box" with a wrapping caption Label filling it.
⍝ NB: each eWC is assigned (_←) so the dfn does not return early on the first
⍝ bare expression.
 mkbox←{
     (nm cap P S C A ac)←⍵
     _←nm eWC'SubForm'('Posn' P)('Size' S)('BCol' C)('EdgeStyle' 'Border')('Attach' A)('AutoConf' ac)
     _←(nm,'.CAP')eWC'Label' cap(3 4)((¯6+1⊃S),(¯8+2⊃S))
     0
 }

⍝ Form is 800x800 to match the Splitter's pane sizing.
 'F1'eWC'Form' 'AutoConf and Attach'(0 0)(800 800)('Coord' COORD)

⍝ Two panes divided by a vertical splitter. Dragging it changes their WIDTH,
⍝ so the boxes inside reconfigure horizontally per their Attach.
 'F1.LEFT'eWC'SubForm'('Posn'(0 0))('Size'(800 300))('BCol'(245 245 245))
 'F1.RIGHT'eWC'SubForm'('Posn'(0 303))('Size'(800 497))('BCol'(255 255 255))('Attach' 'Top' 'Left' 'Bottom' 'Right')
 'F1.SPLIT'eWC'Splitter' 'F1.LEFT' 'F1.RIGHT'('Posn'(0 300))

⍝ --- LEFT pane: AutoConf contrast + pinned + proportional ---
 'F1.LEFT.TITLE'eWC'Label' 'AutoConf + Attach'(8 10)(22 280)
 'F1.LEFT.I1'eWC'Label' 'Drag the splitter to resize the panes →'(33 10)(18 285)

 mkbox 'F1.LEFT.PIN'('Pinned',LF,'Top Left Top Left')(62 10)(52 150)(255 210 225)('Top' 'Left' 'Top' 'Left')3
 mkbox 'F1.LEFT.PROP'('Proportional',LF,'None x4 (scales with pane)')(122 10)(66 270)(200 245 245)('None' 'None' 'None' 'None')3

 'F1.LEFT.ACLBL'eWC'Label' 'Same Attach, different AutoConf:'(198 10)(16 285)
 mkbox 'F1.LEFT.AC3'('AutoConf 3',LF,'accepts resize → stretches')(218 10)(50 270)(200 245 200)('Top' 'Left' 'Top' 'Right')3
 mkbox 'F1.LEFT.AC0'('AutoConf 0',LF,'ignores resize → frozen')(280 10)(50 270)(255 205 205)('Top' 'Left' 'Top' 'Right')0

⍝ --- RIGHT pane: window-frame edge anchoring (toolbar / status / sidebars / fill) ---
 mkbox 'F1.RIGHT.TB'('Toolbar',LF,'Top Left Top Right')(10 10)(40 477)(200 220 255)('Top' 'Left' 'Top' 'Right')3
 mkbox 'F1.RIGHT.LB'('Left side',LF,'Top Left Bottom Left')(60 10)(680 110)(255 245 200)('Top' 'Left' 'Bottom' 'Left')3
 mkbox 'F1.RIGHT.C'('Center fill',LF,'Top Left Bottom Right')(60 130)(680 237)(225 210 255)('Top' 'Left' 'Bottom' 'Right')3
 mkbox 'F1.RIGHT.RB'('Right side',LF,'Top Right Bottom Right')(60 377)(680 110)(255 220 190)('Top' 'Right' 'Bottom' 'Right')3
 mkbox 'F1.RIGHT.SB'('Status bar',LF,'Bottom Left Bottom Right')(750 10)(40 477)(200 255 200)('Bottom' 'Left' 'Bottom' 'Right')3

 :If ~connected
     ⎕EX 'F1.HR'
 :EndIf
